/T (This distinction is precisely what Etzold's \(2023\) intersecting \(im\)mobilities framework captures i.e. pastoral mobility, sedentarization, forced displacement and labour or educational migration are occurring simultaneously across Horn of Africa communities, each shaped differently by drought and conflict, rather than pastoral movement simply being replaced wholesale by displacement.)
/E (This distinction is precisely what Etzold's \(2023\) intersecting \(im\)mobilities framework captures i.e. pastoral mobility, sedentarization, forced displacement and labour or educational migration are occurring simultaneously across Horn of Africa communities, each shaped differently by drought and conflict, rather than pastoral movement simply being replaced wholesale by displacement.)
