/Title (This gap between documented need and policy attention is precisely the pattern this brief's intersectionality findings describe. Taken together, this literature confirms that our findings reflect well-established regional patterns: pastoral mobility is genuinely diversifying into distinct forms with different risk profiles; displaced women face substantial, quantifiable GBV risk that often peaks after arrival rather than only during flight; and disability-inclusive analysis remains largely absent from the climate and mobility policy frameworks that are supposed to protect the most vulnerable.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1289 0 R
/Next 1280 0 R
>>
endobj
